timeline.body:
The UI considers a message with a blank ID a system message for all jobs

```
bool: {
  should: [
    {
      term: {
        job_id: '', // catch system messages
      },
    },
    {
      term: {
        job_id: jobId, // messages for specified jobId
      },
    },
  ],
},
```

